<title>FINLAND: Rautaruukki '96 profit falls 25 pct.</title>
<headline>Rautaruukki '96 profit falls 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     715 vs 954</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   4.98 vs 7.19</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		    1.50 vs 1.70</p>
<p> Net sales					 12,834 vs 9,213</p>
<p> Operating profit				 1,171 vs 1,385</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast for Finnish steel group Rautaruukki Oy was for a 660 million markka profit.  </p>
<p> Depreciation					 765 vs 623</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 456 vs 431 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items				nil vs 144 charge</p>
<p> Profit before reserves, taxes		  715 vs 810</p>
<p> Taxes						  116 vs 89</p>
<p> Profit before minority interest		199 vs 787</p>
<p> Net profit					   199 vs 786</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    34.4 vs 37.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Rautaruukki Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 6805 0245</p>
